  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --focus: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 1rem 0 2rem;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  background: var(--focus);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 64px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n#reset {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\n\nconst countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is 0.\n- Increase button adds 1.\n- Decrease button subtracts 1 (supports negative numbers).\n- Reset button sets count back to 0.\n- Large, readable output with ID `count`.\n- Pixel aesthetic with a cohesive 5-color palette.\n- Fully keyboard accessible: buttons are focusable, labeled, and have visible focus states.\n- Responsive layout works from 360px wide.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click or tap the buttons to change the count. Keyboard users can Tab to a button and press Enter or Space to activate it.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have `aria-label` attributes for screen readers.\n- Focus indicators are clearly visible.\n- The output uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` so changes are announced.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup\n- `style.css` – styles\n- `script.js` – counter logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No external assets, imports, or server code.\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n- Uses `addEventListener` (no inline handlers).\n- Includes `[hidden] { display: none !important; }` rule.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
